      ],
      "content": "SP 81 SW           STOKE MANDEVILLE             SWALLOW LANE                                                  4/145\t\t\t\t\t\tNo.  11 & No. 15                                                 (Willow Thatch)                                                 (formerly listed as No.15                                                 Willow Thatch). 16.6.83                                                 II Two attached cottages. C17 extended C18, altered. Part timber framed, mostly cased in white painted brick. No. 15 thatched, with old brick chimney. No. 11 slated, with chimney at LH end. 2-storeys. No.15 has door to LH, modern 3-light casement to each floor. Exposed timber framing to LH flank wall. Modern extensions to RH and rear No. 11 forms the LH wing and has central door in open porch and 2 bays of 2-light casements. RCHM I p.283 MON.12. Listing NGR: SP8341310541"
    }
  ],
